{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBER MAYDAY is a VR-exclusive 4v1 asymmetric action game set in a cyberpunk metropolis. Four survivors must complete tasks and escape while evading one powerful killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors: Use decoys and revive skills to deceive the killer while completing tasks across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer: Track and eliminate survivors using guns and speed boosts, plus sabotage their tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment: Navigate a meticulously designed cyberpunk environment with vertical levels and hiding spots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate VR cat-and-mouse game with intense, immersive action that can only be achieved in virtual reality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2419530?t=1747352465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2419530?t=1747352465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419530/934c616386bc6e3ef04b03338a753cb90133cdd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747352465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419530/934c616386bc6e3ef04b03338a753cb90133cdd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747352465","categories":[{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBER MAYDAY is a VR-exclusive 4v1 asymmetric action game set in a cyberpunk metropolis. Four survivors must complete tasks and escape while evading one powerful killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors: Use decoys and revive skills to deceive the killer while completing tasks across the map</p></li><li><p cl